# support/

Test support modules for Riffle's suites, consolidating duplicated setup logic and fixture definitions into single-source-of-truth highlanders. Provides cache configuration, DSL fixtures, pipeline test inputs, and module introspection helpers shared across the test suite.

## Files

- `fence_helpers.ex` -- Project namespaces (waist, engine, pattern layer) and module introspection; shared by three fence files
- `cache_helpers.ex` -- Cache suite preconditions and spy predicates for evaluation-counting assertions
- `config_helpers.ex` -- Application-environment preconditions for default-pipeline module configuration across three test suites
- `dsl_fixtures.ex` -- Canonical DSL fixture corpus: UserPredicates macro module and `.pred` source definitions
- `sia_fixtures.ex` -- Pattern layer test inputs: staging/characterisation pipelines and input datasets
